+---
+id: task-004-add-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Add hourly equipment rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add optional `hourlyPrice` to equipment registration. Rentals shorter than one day may start and end
+at UTC hour boundaries and cost the hourly price multiplied by the number of hours. Reject hourly
+rentals for equipment without an hourly price. Preserve whole-day rental pricing and the long-rental
+discount, and ensure hourly bookings participate in the existing overlap checks. Update the public API
+documentation.
